        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsnl.ca/museum-directory/clarenville-heritage-museum/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Clarenville sits in the Shoal Harbour valley, fronting Random Sound, and is surrounded by a ridge of peaks rising to 152 m.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
